# ==============================================================================
# MeApp Monorepo Environment Variables Example
# ==============================================================================
# SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH: apps/server/.env.example
#
# Copy that file to apps/server/.env.local for local development (this is what
# compose.dev.yaml loads via env_file). All variables - server and client -
# live in one file so the server process and the Expo bundler stay in sync.
#
#   cp apps/server/.env.example apps/server/.env.local
#
# This root file is kept as a pointer for discoverability only.
# ==============================================================================
